  "content": "<h1>還原方塊輪廓線</h1><p><strong>說明</strong></p><p><em>將方塊輪廓線顏色恢復為預設色彩</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>功能特色</h2><p>（這些功能將進一步提升你的原版遊戲體驗）&nbsp;</p><p>本模組專為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG 模組包</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/rpg-pvp-swords-and-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">RPG PVP 工具與盔甲資源包</a> 設計，能將任何被染色的方塊輪廓線恢復為預設的原版顏色。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/782/679/restore-block-lines-screenshot.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"678\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即獲取伺服器，與朋友一同遊玩！點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>或下方橫幅，並使用優惠碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 即可享 25% 折扣！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
